<newsitem itemid="62622" id="root" date="1996-09-18" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Costain extends H1 loss to 19.2 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Costain extends H1 loss to 19.2 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>6 months toJune 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		38.2 loss	    vs 21.6 loss</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 Nil		    vs Nil</p>
<p> Pretax		     19.2 loss	    vs 10.4 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   360		    vs 458</p>
<p>NOTE - Engineering to construction group Costain was forced to undergo radical financial restructuring over the summer in a last-ditch survival plan which gave around 40 percent of the group's shares to Intria of Malaysia.  </p>
<p> Operating loss	   13.0		   vs 4.0</p>
<p> Interest payable	 6.2		    vs 6.4</p>
<p> Tax			  0.70		   vs 0.30</p>
<p> Net taxed		  19.9		   vs 10.7</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
